Chrysler is replacing its Sebring with the 200 sedan for 2011. The fresh-look 200��s exterior, interior, powertrains and suspension benefit from significant upgrades.
The 200 is offered in three models: 200 LX, $19,245; 200 Touring, $21,245; and 200 Limited, $23,745. A 200 S will be offered later.
